    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>You are capable of amazing feats of agility on horseback. You can use any of your Performer Skills and unmodified Dodge skill when on horseback. Further, when mounted, you can make your Move at the start of the Round instead of on your Turn.</p>\n<p>Riders with the <em>Trick Riding&nbsp;Talent </em>reduce <em>Shooting From Horseback</em> difficulty by 1 step.</p>"
